  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now according to the question,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Im</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>If&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>}</mo></math></p><p>A covers a part of negative real axis and therefore, does not contain whole real axis</p><p>Similarly if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>}</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;covers part of positive real axis and therefore does not cover whole real axis.</p><p>Hence, both are false.</p>"
  }
